A '''Tadgang''' is a {{Rare}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from water on [[Moonglade Marsh]].

== Spawning ==
A '''Tadgang''' can be fished up from water on [[Moonglade Marsh]]. It requires {{skl|fishing|level IX (9)}} or higher to be fished up.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for a '''Tadgang''' is {{Green|1,500}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|15%|1|6.67|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Currently, there are no modifiers that can be used to increase its weight.

