== Behavior ==
'''Tadgangs''' spawn in groups of {{Green|3}} or {{Green|5}} tadpoles when caught. They swim towards the player, despite being able to deal no damage. Each one has {{stat|hp|1}}, even when [[Runic]].

Once the final '''Tadgang''' is killed, it transforms into a frog with {{stat|hp|5,000}}. It walks towards the player to deal damage.

